data: {"id": "a05563c2bfe4452d-thinking-parallel_evidence-2653", "run_id": "a05563c2bfe4452d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已收集到足够的证据来回答 NotReady 的直接原因。\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 当前状态\n- **phase**: Running（Pod 正常运行中，非 CrashLoopBackOff）\n- **containerStatuses.app.ready**: **False**（容器未就绪）\n- **restarts**: 0（无重启，排除崩溃恢复场景）\n- **command**: `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n- **node**: node2\n\n### 2. Readiness Probe 配置\n从 kubectl_get_yaml 确认了 `readinessProbe` 配置，Probe 检测到返回 HTTP 503。\n\n### 3. Pod 事件（kubectl_events）\n```\nWarning  Unhealthy  3m6s (x1870 over 93m)  kubelet  Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503\n``", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788463678404, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

